Examples from subways in China’s Yangtze Delta, full of soft and fertile alluvial soils, are helpful comparisons.
Zhongsheng station on Nanjing Metro Line 7 (a busy station with #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/nJyWc3B0LYJPGPE1Up5iCA")[40,000 daily riders]#super[#link(<src42>)[\[42\]]]) was built cut-and-cover only #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4l7RbnS01yLp1p2Zdee_yA#:~:text=%E5%87%80%E8%B7%9D%E4%BB%85-,0.6m,-%EF%BC%8C%E8%80%83%E8%99%91%E6%97%A2%E6%9C%89%E7%AB%99")[2 ft beneath]#super[#link(<src43>)[\[43\]]] the existing Line 10 station in #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/4l7RbnS01yLp1p2Zdee_yA#:~:text=%E5%9B%BD%E5%86%85%E6%89%BF%E5%8E%8B-,%E5%AF%8C%E6%B0%B4%E7%A0%82%E5%B1%82,-%E4%B8%AD%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1")[watery sand]#super[#link(<src44>)[\[44\]]]. #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/SBoJE69QTtuc8mzZgKiWwQ")[Settlement was limited to 2.9 mm (0.11 in)]#super[#link(<src45>)[\[45\]]] through #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/E93D6tELgYmRYaiNY6hhAw")[ground freezing]#super[#link(<src46>)[\[46\]]], a #link("https://urbanny.com/project/mta-second-avenue-subway-tunneling-structural-geotechnical/#:~:text=despite%20numerous%20borings.-,Ground%20freezing,-was%20determined%20as")[technique already used in SAS Phase 1]#super[#link(<src47>)[\[47\]]].
For comparison, the #link("https://transitcosts.com/wp-content/uploads/Italian_Case_Study.pdf#page=120")[maximum allowed settlement in historic sections of Rome]#super[#link(<src48>)[\[48\]]], with priceless monuments from Antiquity like the Colosseum, is 3 mm (0.12 in).
Similarly, the city-center Yuyuan Garden station on Shanghai Line 14 was built only #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/fE7l03P3F4j28NoO6eoegA#:~:text=10%E5%8F%B7%E7%BA%BF%EF%BC%8C-,%E5%9E%82%E7%9B%B4%E8%B7%9D%E7%A6%BB1.2%E7%B1%B3,-%E3%80%82")[4 ft beneath]#super[#link(<src49>)[\[49\]]] Line 10, and Jing’an Temple station on Shanghai Metro Line 14 used #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/R7QkLaX_Mt3iPXfBini8rw")[rectangular pipe-jacking]#super[#link(<src50>)[\[50\]]] and #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/R7QkLaX_Mt3iPXfBini8rw#:~:text=%E6%96%B0%E5%9E%8B%E5%87%8F%E6%91%A9-,%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%98%E6%B3%A5,-%E6%B5%86%E5%92%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94")[thixotropic mud]#super[#link(<src51>)[\[51\]]] to #link("https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/R7QkLaX_Mt3iPXfBini8rw#:~:text=%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%9C%A8%2D-,15%EF%BD%9E5%20mm,-%E3%80%82")[limit settlement to only 0.2-0.6 in]#super[#link(<src52>)[\[52\]]], with both being in watery soft soil and clays.

